{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105545","id":2469109605,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TK59l","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105545","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105545.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105545.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105545","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105545/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105545/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105545/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f3dd43f283208371f44f717321741e46b99931e5","number":105545,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Audio: Change playback position type from float to double","user":{"login":"PizzaLovers007","id":10912951,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwOTEyOTUx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10912951?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007","html_url":"https://github.com/PizzaLovers007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PizzaLovers007/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Two reasons to change this:\r\n* At a default mix rate of 44100, the playback position in seconds can experience rounding errors with a 32-bit type if the value is high enough. 44100 requires 15 free bits in the mantissa to be within 1/2 an audio frame, so the cutoff is 512 seconds before rounding issues occur (512=2^9, and 9+15 > 23 mantissa bits in 32-bit float).\r\n* Internally, AudioStreamPlayback and AudioStream use a 64-bit type for playback position.\r\n\r\nSee this discussion: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105510#discussion_r2049745296\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","description":"","color":"b64245","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestone